{"file":"render-visual-skill-1.0.5-v1.zip","bytes":5915138,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"render-visual-skill","description":"Architecture diagrams, presentation slides, social cards, code snippets and device mockups — authored as HTML/SVG and rendered to crisp PNGs by a local headless Chromium. Includes a 55-part element library (device frames, infrastructure shapes, schematic chart and BI parts, 29 glyphs), places your own screenshots and photos into frames or cropped to a shape, animates sequence diagrams into looping GIFs, and restyles everything through eight swappable themes. Zero npm dependencies.","version":"1.0.5","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/imshaikot/render-visual-skill","homepage":"https://github.com/imshaikot/render-visual-skill","keywords":["diagram","architecture","slides","presentation","og-card","social-card","code-snippet","mockup","screenshot","chart","design","png","svg","visualization"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/render-visual/SKILL.md","name":"render-visual","description":"**DELIVERY SKILL** — Produce polished diagrams, slides and social cards as crisp PNGs, JPEGs or PDFs by authoring HTML/SVG and rendering it with a local headless Chromium. Eight themes (ember, slate, paper, terminal, blueprint, frost, neon, sepia), one flag. Lays mermaid flowchart text out into a figure, deterministically. Also frames screenshots and photos in a browser, phone or terminal frame, or cropped to a shape. USE FOR: architecture and flow diagrams, slide decks, og/social cards, blog and README figures, any designed image a doc needs. DO NOT USE FOR: data charts from datasets (use a plotting library), capturing a live UI, photo retouching, or any surface without a shell — write inline SVG. TRIGGERS: mermaid, flowchart TD, graph TD, diagram, flow chart, architecture visual, swimlane, tree view, cluster, deployment, mind map, slide deck, presentation, og card, social card, banner, blog figure, browser frame, 